The git cache is keyed by URL only; a second pin of the same URL moves the same checkout. The offline fallback does not verify the pin: a source pinned to SHA A serves SHA B from cache with "using cache" (probe 06). `check(undefined)` for a SHA pin returns false. Online explicit SHA sync and rollback work. Code: src/sources/git.ts:30-32, 58-97, 105-109. Fix: per-revision snapshots or pin verification; when the pin cannot be met, keep the installed state.

Repro: probe file by the skilletor-71 audit session, copied to docs-free scratch; reproduced by the orchestrator against exports of e371b13 AND v0.2.0 (pre-existing, not introduced by k62/k63/k65).

